  "title": "Easy Banana Split Pie",
  "description": "Butter, confectioners ' sugar, eggs, and a bit of vanilla are creamed together and combined with grated chocolate and sliced bananas. This lovely concoction is then spooned into a baked pie shell and garnished with whipped cream and nuts.",
